    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d126">

                <pb facs="0356" n="272" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg272"/>

                <head>No. 122.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Señor Flores to Mr. Bayard</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >New York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1885-05-13"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 13,
                        1885</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I arrived to-day and will call upon you to-morrow. I respectfully request that
                    you should telegraph to American agents in Ecuador to: stop any proceedings in
                    the Santos affair till you have heard me.</p>
                <closer><signed>ANTONIO FLORES,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Ecuador
                        Minister.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
